@base = http://localhost:4004

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Dashboard
POST {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/getDashboard
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Price changes
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/PriceChangeRequests?$expand=supplier,grade

### Calculation runs
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/rmc/CalculationRuns?$expand=priceChange

### Admin settings
GET {{base}}/odata/v4/admin/AppSettings
